      "title": "Lesson intro",
      "minutes": 40,
      "learn": [
        "welcher asks which. dieser points at this one. They take the endings of der, die, das.",
        "Nominative: welcher Patient, welches Zimmer, welche Akte.",
        "Accusative masculine: welchen Patienten, diesen Patienten.",
        "Dative: in welchem Zimmer, in diesem Zimmer."
      ],
