      "heroTitle": "The same endings as der",
      "heroImage": "bed",
      "story": [
        "<b>der</b> Patient → <b>welcher</b> Patient → <b>dieser</b> Patient. <b>das</b> Zimmer → welches, dieses. <b>die</b> Akte → welche, diese.",
        "Only the masculine accusative changes further: welchen Patienten, diesen Patienten.",
        "After in for a place, the dative: in welchem Zimmer, in diesem Zimmer."
      ],
